label: Fetch Clipped Soil Polygons
description: >-
  POST the parcel WKT to USDA Soil Data Access and get back the soil map-unit
  polygons CLIPPED TO THE PARCEL, server-side.

  The `many` output is the fan-out: one parcel becomes N soil segments, each
  taking its own path with its own lineage.

  blue-ribbon's fetchClippedSoilPolygons, ssurgo.ts:38.
effect: http
input: SoilQuery
output:
  many: SoilPolygonWkt
